    "DefaultText": "A field of hemp plants growing steadily. Will be ready to harvest when mature."
  },
  "CardHelpSection": {
    "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_hemp_field_growing",
    "LocalizationKey": "herbsfungihempfieldgrowing_CardHelpSection",
    "DefaultText": "<b>Growth:</b> Takes 30 days to mature.\n\n<b>Harvest:</b> Once mature, harvest for hemp stalks, flowers, and seeds.\n\n<b>Care:</b> Tend it once a day. Left untended it weakens and dies in about ten days. In winter it stops growing and dies in about two days, so harvest before the frost."
  },
